  "onb_desc_dashboard": "Your dashboard — a countdown to the wedding, shortcuts and the key figures in one place.",
  "onb_desc_guests": "The invitee list, their details, RSVP statuses and preferences — across the sub-tabs.",
  "onb_desc_budget": "Keep every wedding cost in one place — sub-tabs alongside.",
  "onb_desc_room": "Lay out tables and objects on an interactive plan. Turn on „Edit plan\" to drag things around and resize them.",
  "onb_desc_schedule": "Write out the running order of the day and the checklist — in the sub-tabs.",
  "onb_desc_tasks": "Write out tasks, assign people, and link them to the budget, a vendor or a gift.",
  "onb_desc_vendors": "Your supplier base — contacts, contracts, payment instalments and budget links.",
  "onb_desc_transport": "Organise how guests get there — routes, vehicles and passenger assignments.",
  "onb_desc_accommodation": "Manage accommodation for guests — places, rooms and bookings.",
  "onb_desc_music": "Build the wedding playlist and collect song suggestions from guests (QR code).",
  "onb_desc_gifts": "A record of gifts received, favours for guests and your wish list — across the sub-tabs.",
  "onb_desc_gallery": "A shared gallery of wedding photos, plus QR codes to share with guests.",
  "onb_desc_games": "Wedding games — entertainment for guests, including Wedding Bingo generated from the schedule. More games coming.",
  "onb_desc_keepsakes": "Wedding keepsakes — the guest book, advice for the couple, the time capsule and the guest map. In preparation.",
  "onb_desc_analytics": "Charts and planning statistics — progress, costs and attendance.",
  "onb_desc_rsvp": "Manage RSVPs and share the online form with your guests.",
  "onb_desc_settings": "Here you'll find configuration, access, sign-in and tools. You can restart the guide any time from the menu under the logo. That's everything — good luck!",
  "onb_desc_fallback": "The „{section}\" section of the app.",
  "onb_sub_guests_1Title": "List",
  "onb_sub_guests_1Desc": "The invitee list — add guests and manage their details.",
  "onb_sub_guests_2Title": "Details",
  "onb_sub_guests_2Desc": "The full record: RSVP status, diet, age and notes.",
  "onb_sub_guests_3Title": "Summary",
  "onb_sub_guests_3Desc": "Aggregate statistics: guest count, replies, children and diets.",
  "onb_sub_budget_1Title": "Summary",
  "onb_sub_budget_1Desc": "Total budget against spending — how much is already allocated.",
  "onb_sub_budget_2Title": "Venue",
  "onb_sub_budget_2Desc": "The venue cost — the per-person rate is multiplied by the guest count (seated, unseated and staff).",
  "onb_sub_budget_3Title": "Expenses",
  "onb_sub_budget_3Desc": "Add all other expenses and group them by category.",
  "onb_sub_budget_4Title": "Alcohol",
  "onb_sub_budget_4Desc": "Plan the types, quantities and costs of alcohol.",
  "onb_sub_budget_5Title": "Soft drinks",
  "onb_sub_budget_5Desc": "Water, juices, fizzy drinks — quantities and costs.",
  "onb_sub_budget_6Title": "Honeymoon",
  "onb_sub_budget_6Desc": "The honeymoon budget, kept apart from the wedding costs. „Summary\" also lists every payment and deadline.",
  "onb_sub_schedule_1Title": "Running order",
  "onb_sub_schedule_1Desc": "Programme items with times — from the ceremony to the last dance.",
  "onb_sub_schedule_2Title": "Checklist",
  "onb_sub_schedule_2Desc": "Things to tick off before and during the wedding.",
  "onb_sub_gifts_1Title": "Received",
  "onb_sub_gifts_1Desc": "Note what you got and from whom — useful when writing thank-yous.",
  "onb_sub_gifts_2Title": "For guests",
  "onb_sub_gifts_2Desc": "Plan thank-yous and favours for your guests.",
  "onb_sub_gifts_3Title": "Wish list",
  "onb_sub_gifts_3Desc": "Your wish list — let guests know what would make you happy.",
  "onb_set_1Title": "Settings · Sync status",
  "onb_set_1Desc": "Check whether your data is synced to the cloud (Firestore).",
  "onb_set_2Title": "Settings · Guest visibility",
  "onb_set_2Desc": "You decide which sections guests see, and between which dates. For example, turn RSVP on right away and the gallery only on the wedding day.",
  "onb_set_3Title": "Settings · Guest join code",
  "onb_set_3Desc": "A six-character code a guest uses to join the wedding on their own account. Verification is threefold: the code, the wedding date and the surname.",
  "onb_set_4Title": "Settings · Guest link and QR",
  "onb_set_4Desc": "The link and QR code to the guest zone — it works without signing in and without installing the app. This is what you print on invitations or leave on the tables.",
  "onb_set_5Title": "Settings · Guest interactions",
  "onb_set_5Desc": "Everything guests have sent in: RSVPs, guest book entries, advice, photos, music suggestions and game scores. You moderate here too — delete anything unsuitable with a single tap.",
  "onb_set_6Title": "Settings · People and access",
  "onb_set_6Desc": "This is where you add a co-organiser (best man, mum) and a planner. „Add person\" → pick a role → give the e-mail of someone with an account, or generate a single-use invitation code and send it to them. The invitee enters the code on their wedding list („I have an invitation code\"). For a planner you set an expiry date — after it, the wedding disappears from their list. You can block and restore access at any time. Only the wedding's owner can change anything here — that's a safeguard, not a limitation.",
  "onb_set_7Title": "Settings · Configuration",
  "onb_set_7Desc": "The event name, date, venues, cost split and dictionaries.",
  "onb_set_8Title": "Settings · Sign-in",
  "onb_set_8Desc": "Biometrics, a PIN/pattern and this device's security status.",
  "onb_set_9Title": "Settings · Developer",
  "onb_set_9Desc": "Data export/import and backups.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_dashboard": "Your CLIENT's wedding dashboard — the countdown, progress and statistics. Every wedding on your account has its own dashboard; switch between them under „Switch wedding\".",
  "onb_plannerDesc_guests": "Your client's guest list with replies and preferences. This is your clients' personal data — treat it as confidential.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_budget": "Your client's wedding budget. This is usually where you show the couple where the money goes and where the savings are — sub-tabs alongside.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_room": "The seating plan, to agree with the client and the venue. A printed table layout is one of the most requested parts of your service.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_schedule": "The running order — your single most important working document. It's what goes to the venue staff, the photographer and the band.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_tasks": "Tasks with people assigned. Use this to split the work between yourself, the couple and your subcontractors.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_vendors": "A supplier base with contracts and instalments. Running several weddings, you build up your own private list of trusted contacts here.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_analytics": "Charts and statistics — a ready-made progress report for your client.",
  "onb_plannerDesc_settings": "Wedding configuration, people's access and section visibility for guests. Remember: the couple remain the wedding's owner — they grant and revoke access. You can restart the guide from the menu under the logo.",
  "onb_planner_1Title": "Several weddings on one account",
  "onb_planner_1Desc": "As a planner you can run as many weddings as you like. Switch between them in the menu under the logo → „Switch wedding\". Each wedding's data is fully separated — client A never sees client B's wedding.",
  "onb_planner_2Title": "Your access may have an expiry date",
  "onb_planner_2Desc": "The couple grant the planner access, can set an expiry date and can block or restore it at any time. Once it expires the wedding disappears from your list — that's normal, not a fault.",
  "onb_planner_3Title": "Handing the wedding to the couple",
  "onb_planner_3Desc": "The couple's account outranks everything: only they add people and issue invitations. When your work together ends, the couple take full control — nothing needs moving or exporting.",
  "onb_guest_1Title": "Welcome to the guest zone",
  "onb_guest_1Desc": "This is your corner of the couple's wedding. You'll find everything you need as a guest here — no account, nothing to install.",
  "onb_guest_2Title": "Confirming attendance (RSVP)",
  "onb_guest_2Desc": "Let them know whether you're coming and with how many people. Mention your diet or allergies if you have any. One reply is enough — if your plans change, come back here and update it.",
  "onb_guest_3Title": "Running order",
  "onb_guest_3Desc": "Hour by hour: the ceremony, the reception, the cake, the first dance. You'll also see a countdown to the wedding.",
  "onb_guest_4Title": "Gallery — add your photos",
  "onb_guest_4Desc": "Upload photos straight from your phone and look through the ones other guests added. This is how the couple get shots no photographer could take.",
  "onb_guest_5Title": "Music — suggest a song",
  "onb_guest_5Desc": "Search for a song and send your suggestion to the couple. Suggestions go to them alone — there's no public list and no voting.",
  "onb_guest_6Title": "Wedding games",
  "onb_guest_6Desc": "A quiz about the couple, True/False, Guess the photo, photo challenges and Wedding Bingo. Only the couple see the scores — there's no public ranking, so play for fun.",
  "onb_guest_7Title": "Games — how they work",
  "onb_guest_7Desc": "The quiz, True/False and Guess the photo work your score out straight away on your phone. You can have another go — the new score replaces the old one. In photo challenges you send one photo per task.",
  "onb_guest_8Title": "Wedding keepsakes",
  "onb_guest_8Desc": "Leave your mark: an entry in the guest book, advice for the couple, a message for the time capsule and a pin on the guest map.",
  "onb_guest_9Title": "Guest book and advice",
  "onb_guest_9Desc": "You can leave several entries — wishes, a memory, a piece of good advice. Other guests see them, so it's a bit like a shared chronicle.",
  "onb_guest_10Title": "Time capsule and guest map",
  "onb_guest_10Desc": "The capsule is a private message — only the couple will read it. On the map you mark where you're travelling from; one pin per guest, and you can correct it.",
  "onb_guest_11Title": "That's everything!",
  "onb_guest_11Desc": "Sections appear and disappear according to what the couple have shared — if you can't see something, it may become available closer to the wedding. Have a wonderful time!",
  "onb_planningTitle": "Where do I start?",
  "onb_planningDesc": "A suggested order for planning the wedding. Tick off completed steps and the bar shows your progress. You can open it from Settings at any time.",
  "onb_qrTitle": "QR codes for guests",
  "onb_qrDesc": "Share QR codes with your guests leading to the gallery, music, the schedule and RSVPs.",
